      "text": "```\n   US NEWSPRINT CONSUMPTION:\n   ─────────────────────────\n   1990: ~12 Mt/yr\n   2000: ~10 Mt/yr\n   2010: ~5 Mt/yr\n   2019: ~1.5 Mt/yr\n   2023: ~0.9 Mt/yr (-92% from peak!)"
