      },
      "text": "The decline of printing paper has been more than offset by corrugated board\ngrowth driven by e-commerce."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md#021",
      "path": [
        "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
