        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Disruption and the Paper Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   E-COMMERCE EFFECT ON CORRUGATED:\n   ──────────────────────────────────\n   Traditional retail: 1 box serves ~10 items (pallet-shipped in store)\n   E-commerce: 1 box per ~1–2 items (shipped to home)\n   → 5–10× more boxes per unit of goods sold"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md#022",
      "path": [
        "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
