        "section": "papermaking",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Disruption and the Paper Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "US CORRUGATED BOARD SHIPMENTS:\n   ──────────────────────────────\n   2000: ~340 billion ft²\n   2010: ~350 billion ft²\n   2020: ~430 billion ft²  (COVID e-commerce surge)\n   2023: ~430 billion ft² (plateau after COVID spike)\n   Annual growth rate: +2.5–3.5%/yr structural"
    },
    {
