      "text": "Key grades growing:\n   ─────────────────────\n   E-commerce: light, high-burst, printable (marketing at doorstep)\n   Fresh food: cold chain, moisture resistance\n   Heavy duty: appliances, furniture shipped direct\n```"
    },
