      "text": "Not traditional paper — PE/PP/polyester laminates replacing glass, cans, and\nrigid plastic for food. Paper laminate component growing but complex:"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md#026",
      "path": [
