        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Disruption and the Paper Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   PAPER-BASED FLEXIBLE PACKAGING TREND:\n   ────────────────────────────────────────\n   Traditional: PE/PE or PET/PE/EVOH laminates\n   Trend: replace plastic layer with paper where functional (dry goods)\n   Challenge: paper cannot match PE for moisture barrier without coating\n   Solutions: thin PE or bio-PE coating on paper (recyclable with paper?)\n   Current state: recyclability claims contested — paper + plastic laminate\n                  typically NOT recyclable as paper in most MRF systems\n```"
    },
