      "text": "```\n   MILL CLOSURES AND CONVERSIONS (P&W paper, US/Canada):\n   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n   2000–2023: >100 paper machines permanently shut in North America\n   ~50% capacity reduction in US printing paper"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DIGITAL-DISRUPTION.md#031",
      "path": [
