        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Disruption and the Paper Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONVERSION STRATEGIES:\n   ──────────────────────\n   P&W mill → packaging board (requires significant capital, works if\n               suitable fiber and machine width/speed)\n   Newsprint → specialty (LWC coatings, lighter grades)\n   Close entirely (uneconomic in current demand scenario)"
    },
